Subject: [PATCH 4/4] docs: describe the Q-MATH fork differences and how to
 reapply them

The README replaces the stale BTC-selection note with a table of every
difference from upstream: the scheduler opt-ins, correctness and cleanup
items, toolchain and edition, policy headers, and the removed guard. It
also explains how to reapply the series onto a newer upstream with
git am --3way. QMATH_VENDOR_PROVENANCE.md documents the new options and
how the qmath-patches/ series is generated and verified.

